omaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=Before%20Bazzle%20could%20do,squarely%20in%20the%20face.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronomaton\" by Ryan Miller. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"chronomaton-2012-07-10-e5","era":null,"summary":"On the second morning Bazzle finds a severed clockwork head made from the guard's helmet, his own reading crystals and the stirrups and teeth.","participants":["bazzle","chronomaton"],"location":"bazzle-s-workshop","importance":"minor","page":"stories/chronomaton-2012-07-10","order":359,"story_date":"2012-07-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":26,"quote":"This was a clockwork head.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=This%20was%20a%20clockwork%20head.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronomaton","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ryan Miller"],"date":"2012-07-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=This%20was%20a%20clockwork%20head.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronomaton\" by Ryan Miller. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"chronomaton-2012-07-10-e6","era":null,"summary":"As Bazzle crawls to the key, the creature strikes the back of his neck and slides the key into place.","participants":["bazzle","chronomaton"],"location":"bazzle-s-workshop","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronomaton-2012-07-10","order":359,"story_date":"2012-07-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":30,"quote":"just as the thing's arm connected with the back of his neck.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronomaton-2012-07-10#:~:text=just%20as%20the%20thing%27s,back%20of%20his%20neck.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronomaton","series":"Magic Story","authors":["